./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_03/records/full_2026-07-06__rec_000090_0d9defcc25c1/full_2026_07_06_rec_000090_0d9defcc25c1_docling_json_20260812_183921/docling_graph/nodes.csv:30:"TaxonomyCodedRoute_9f4097c80926fb93","TaxonomyCodedRoute","entity","TaxonomyCodedRoute","Abstract-conditioned sample generation","C2S-Scale","pretraining","Interpret the abstract summary below from a single-cell dataset. Create a list of 192 genes in order of decreasing expression for 11 distinct Homo sapiens cells that you would expect based on the abstract.","The study used single-cell RNA sequencing and VDJ sequencing to analyze the immune compartment in 16 human tissues from 12 donors, identifying 360,000 cells. They developed a machine learning tool, CellTypist, for accurate cell type annotation, revealing tissue-specific immune cell features and clonal architecture of T and B cells. This multitissue approach provides a foundation for identifying detailed immune cell types using a common reference dataset and tissue-integrated analysis.","Single-cell abstract summary of a multitissue human immune-compartment study using scRNA-seq and VDJ-seq.","text","['Interpret the abstract summary below from a single-cell dataset.', 'Create a list of 192 genes in order of decreasing expression for 11 distinct Homo sapiens cells that you would expect based on the abstract.']","['Interpret a single-cell dataset abstract.', 'Generate ranked gene lists for 11 Homo sapiens cells.']","Prompt with an abstract summary from a single-cell dataset and an instruction to generate gene-ranked cell sentences.","text_native_token_stream","plain_language_prompt_or_question","Prompt: Interpret the abstract summary below from a single-cell dataset. Create a list of 192 genes in order of decreasing expression for 11 distinct Homo sapiens cells that you would expect based on the abstract.","tokenizer_sequence","instruction_or_query","actual_model_input